<type>: <short description>

# Format: <type>(<scope>): <description> (scope is optional)

# Types:
# feat     - New functionality
# fix      - Bug fix
# test     - Add or modify tests
# refactor - Restructure code without changing behavior
# docs     - Documentation changes
# chore    - Maintenance
# build    - Dependency or build changes
# ci       - CI/CD changes

# Scopes:
# video, notes, api, ui, tests, deps

# Rules:
# - Use imperative mood: "add" instead of "added"
# - Keep the subject concise (ideally under 50 characters)
# - Explain what changed, not the implementation details
# - Add a body below if the change requires explanation